B.Xg=new A.aa("How are expenses split?","Equally between the members you pick, or by exact custom amounts. Splits are calculated in paisa, and remainder paisa are shared one by one so the total is always exact and balances sum to zero.")
B.WM=new A.aa("How does receipt verification work?","Every expense needs a receipt photo or PDF. A roommate (never the payer) verifies it against the amount, or disputes it with a reason. The payer can then correct the amount - the old and new values stay in the expense's audit history.")
B.X0=new A.aa("How do payments and Smart Settle work?",'Smart Settle works out the fewest payments that clear everyone\'s balance. You can pay a roommate directly (their JazzCash, Easypaisa or bank details are on the request), tap "I Have Paid", and the creditor confirms - only confirmation moves the balance.')
B.X1=new A.aa("I forgot my PIN. What now?",'Use "Forgot PIN?" on the login screen. We email a one-time reset link (valid 1 hour) and you choose a new PIN. Your old PIN is never revealed or reused.')
B.Xe=new A.aa("What is Demo Mode?","A registration-free sample household (Ali, Ayesha, Bilal) so you can explore every feature. Demo data stays on your device and is separate from real accounts.")
B.WT=new A.aa("Why does a category show a warning?","When one category passes 40% of the monthly budget, HomeSplit flags it so the household notices before the budget does.")
